{"steam_appid":3772810,"steam_name":"Desktop Defender","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3772810/199355801/e30e7f8c1f90c71fa42bd6dd23e0b7475447fcd6/1750371762/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753289089","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257145481/2c4e55f32d605e469fe8dcd22dfba2bc3c79f77e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753289089","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/277332e2a279915a806c0e6d25e59d5c92d0ea18/ss_277332e2a279915a806c0e6d25e59d5c92d0ea18.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780938721","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/2de7805579f940ab5d91c38294aeda3cba62ef0f/ss_2de7805579f940ab5d91c38294aeda3cba62ef0f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780938721","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/197f1a29ca33ee63d34c419d2ea7ffc1b804575c/ss_197f1a29ca33ee63d34c419d2ea7ffc1b804575c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780938721","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/286a741f562ee6474155bab3da5d872447f1b844/ss_286a741f562ee6474155bab3da5d872447f1b844.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780938721","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/cc72b43314683d49db2227a0435213e56a9e4437/ss_cc72b43314683d49db2227a0435213e56a9e4437.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780938721"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your desktop in this idle auto-battler that sits quietly in the corner of your screen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off endless waves of enemies, upgrade your lone tower, and grow stronger across ascensions while you go about your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/extras/d2723eb37ccfb64a3ebdc9220a44dddc.poster.avif?t=1780938721\" width=231 height=231 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/extras/d2723eb37ccfb64a3ebdc9220a44dddc.webm?t=1780938721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up and unlock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain XP, level up, and earn rewards such as permanent upgrades, powerful loot, or new weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt for loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop rare gear with huge bonuses. Equip the best and create broken builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend and grow stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset your run to earn Ascendium, unlocking cross-ascension upgrades that boost your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/extras/5ffae6d7de646f7988b6aad05bd5a737.poster.avif?t=1780938721\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/extras/5ffae6d7de646f7988b6aad05bd5a737.webm?t=1780938721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772810/extras/5ffae6d7de646f7988b6aad05bd5a737.mp4?t=1780938721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Always on, never in the way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs in a small corner of your screen so you can work, browse, or game while defending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust size and position to fit your setup. Stay passive or play actively. It's up to you!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD FX-4350 / Intel® Core™ i3-3210<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon™ R7 260X (2GB VRAM) / NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 750(2GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong>  DirectX Compatible Sound Card</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Conradical Games"],"publishers":["Poysky Productions"],"release_date":"4 Nov, 2025"}